<title>FRANCE: Lagardere confirms Thomson appeal.</title>
<headline>Lagardere confirms Thomson appeal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lagadere Groupe confirmed it had lodged an appeal with France's highest administrative court against a Privatisation Commission decision which thwarted a joint bid by Lagardere and Daewoo for Thomson SA .</p>
<p>But a company official declined to comment on the &quot;ongoing procedure&quot;, only adding that the company &quot;has always done its best to defend the interests of its shareholders.&quot;</p>
</text>
